    "turn_idx": 15,
    "turn_text": "You know, speaking of the Sonarville kids, which we're going to get to later, for those who don't know, they walked out of about 200 of them walked out of school yesterday about gun control issues. And I believe their position is until there is meaningful gun reform. And obviously everybody defines that differently. They're going to keep walking out on Wednesdays. You're the former mayor of Sonarville, for those who don't recall. Are you okay with that?",
