    "turn_idx": 16,
    "turn_text": "I have a full problem with it every week, but I certainly, there are other ways to express your commitment in skipping classes. I mean, once was a good thing. After that, I'll leave that to the school committee and the school department and decide what they think is an appropriate way to work with these young people. I met with them yesterday. They seem sincere. They seem genuine. They seem committed. So my hope and expectation is that they understand that education comes first and commitment to social issues is right after that. So I think you can do both. I don't think you have to necessarily walk out of school every week. to prove your commitment and I hope that they find other ways to express themselves.",
